Krita Nova 17 - Krita Nova loading screen

1. New splash artwork krita/data/splash/krita-nova-splash.jpg (1920x960,
   "KRITA nova edition", by https://vgen.co/novaillusion), used on all
   platforms as :/splash/nova.jpg. The old artwork is no longer packed into
   the resources (splash.qrc / splash-android.qrc), so the app does not
   grow (the old desktop splash was a 3 MB 4K PNG).
2. KisSplashScreen: the Krita logo and the "KRITA" banner are not drawn (the
   artwork has its own title); the version and loading text move to the
   bottom-right corner; no separate artist credit line (the artwork carries
   its credit). The About dialog and the Android donation screen use the same
   image.

